 "wiki": {
  "title": "White-bellied green pigeon",
  "extract": "The white-bellied green pigeon, also known as Siebold's green pigeon and Japanese green pigeon, is a species of bird in the family Columbidae. It is found in East, and Southeast Asia. Its natural habitat is temperate forests and woodlands. Its population has increased significantly since 2000. It is one of the few green pigeons that migrates.",
